// AntigravityIcon.h -- auto-generated 1-bit PROGMEM mask, 40x40.
// Source: Google Antigravity's logo mark (vector SVG, not the padded app
// icon -- the app-icon PNG variant is a solid-filled rounded square with
// the mark drawn inside; using it directly would have produced a solid
// colored badge silhouette, the exact style already rejected for
// ZaiIcon.h per that file's own header comment). Rasterized via
// rsvg-convert at native aspect ratio (40x37), vertically centered in the
// 40x40 canvas, alpha-thresholded (>50%) to isolate the mark -- same
// drawBitmap convention as WeatherIcons.h/ZaiIcon.h -- see WeatherIcons.h
// for why this is 1-bit PROGMEM and not RGB565 (word-access PROGMEM reads
// crash on this chip).
